VERDICT:
  The family CLEARS (M >= 2/25, ABOVE the window) => NOT a gap member =>
  HYP-4302's 'no gap member' STANDS (my MISTAKE-110 family is loose, not gap).
  BUT its witness is at q = (first prime > B), NOT q <= B => a census capped
  at q <= 50 CANNOT certify families whose composite runners divide lcm(1..50);
  the census q-bound must exceed 50 (smallest safe: 53) OR use ray-transport
  to a bounded residue representative (opus HYP-4266's mechanism -- which is
